<title>JAPAN: Shares of Paris Miki hit record low.</title>
<headline>Shares of Paris Miki hit record low.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Paris Miki Inc hit a record low on Tuesday afternoon, falling on the Tokyo Stock Exchange for the ninth consecutive day, traders said.</p>
<p>By 0445 GMT, shares of Paris Miki had fallen 200 yen to 2,700.</p>
<p>Its previous record low was 2,860 yen marked on Monday.</p>
<p>Paris Miki operates chain stores specialising in eyeglasses.</p>
